WEBVTT

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.917
His Excellency enters!

00:00:43.917 --> 00:00:46.333
Are you the one they call
Princess Half-Demon?

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.333
HALF-DEMON GIRL - TOWA HIGURASHI

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.542
I am the Deputy Shogun of Kanto,
Ogigayatsu Hiiragi Danjo.

00:00:51.542 --> 00:00:54.833
DEPUTY SHOGUN
OF KANTO -
OGIGAYATSU HIIRAGI DANJO

00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:57.375
The name's Towa Higurashi.

00:00:57.667 --> 00:01:00.833
Sorry, but I'm no
Princess Half-Demon.

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:04.167
So she says, Sokyu.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:07.583
My Lord, let me, if you will.

00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:08.208
Princess Half-Demon,
I have here a book that you were carrying.

00:01:08.208 --> 00:01:10.375
TEAMASTER - SOKYU

00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:11.917
NEW SOCIAL STUDIES
AND HISTORY

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:16.375
That idiot! Why'd she have to
bring that back with her?

00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:19.667
Are the things written in here
to be the truth?

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:23.375
This "Reiwa" you hail from...
What sort of land is it?

00:01:24.042 --> 00:01:27.667
I can't say anything.
Or else I'd change history.

00:01:28.125 --> 00:01:30.125
Do answer, Princess Half-Demon.

00:01:30.708 --> 00:01:34.875
You know, you should take my advice
and let me go.

00:01:35.292 --> 00:01:38.875
Things won't be so hot
when my friends get here.

00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:42.333
Such nonsense.

00:01:42.417 --> 00:01:45.042
There is something
I would like for you to see.

00:01:54.083 --> 00:01:55.417
Is that a bike seat?!

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.208
You recognize what this is!

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:01.417
Indeed.
It seems she knows something.

00:02:02.083 --> 00:02:03.917
What's a thing like that doing here?

00:02:04.208 --> 00:02:08.917
This was found when a clam fisher
was raking the river.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.292
It was then presented to us.

00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:16.083
There used to be rumors in
the Musashi Province...

00:02:16.125 --> 00:02:22.083
of a priestess who came through the
Bone Eater's Well from a place called "Tokyo."

00:02:22.833 --> 00:02:25.917
Tokyo? Well? Priestess?!

00:02:26.458 --> 00:02:32.167
This was the saddle she used
to ride her mysterious iron wagon.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:39.542
She and a half-demon named Inuyasha
traveled the land slaying demons.

00:02:39.917 --> 00:02:45.875
What I'm about to share is a tale
that I heard over a decade ago.

00:03:00.875 --> 00:03:05.458
It's been nearly six months
since I made the decision

00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:08.458
to live with Inuyasha
in the Feudal Era.

00:03:10.542 --> 00:03:11.542
The days have been so peaceful,

00:03:11.542 --> 00:03:13.458
PRIESTESS-IN-TRAINING - KAGOME HIGURASHI

00:03:13.458 --> 00:03:18.125
as if the time we spent fighting
for the Shikon Jewel was all a dream.

00:05:01.792 --> 00:05:03.417
INUYASHA: SINCE THEN

00:05:03.417 --> 00:05:05.125
"Inuyasha: Since Then"

00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:10.542
Sango!

00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:12.417
Hello, Kagome.

00:05:12.917 --> 00:05:14.583
Oh, it's Kagome!

00:05:14.625 --> 00:05:16.292
Kagome!

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:20.667
– Look, look!
– What have we got here?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.208
We dug these up!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.292
Lots and lots of them!

00:05:24.875 --> 00:05:26.583
These are kudzu roots.

00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:29.375
If we dry them,
they make good medicine.

00:05:29.417 --> 00:05:31.708
Wow, really?

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:33.042
Oh, that's right.

00:05:33.917 --> 00:05:35.292
Here, I'll give you this.

00:05:35.667 --> 00:05:37.042
What's that?

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:39.292
This is a kikyo root.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:39.625
Kikyo root?

00:05:39.625 --> 00:05:42.042
MIROKU AND
SANGO'S SON -
HISUI

00:05:42.333 --> 00:05:47.667
Kikyo is a very kind plant.
It helps with coughs and fevers.

00:05:47.708 --> 00:05:48.833
Aw, what?

00:05:48.875 --> 00:05:50.667
I wanted food.

00:05:50.833 --> 00:05:53.333
Food, food!

00:05:53.375 --> 00:05:54.708
Food, huh?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:58.708
Come on, you two.
Don't give Kagome such a hard time.

00:05:58.708 --> 00:05:59.667
Okay.

00:06:02.792 --> 00:06:04.333
The seven autumnal flowers?

00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:05.250
Yep.

00:06:05.292 --> 00:06:10.417
It's from the <i>Manyoshu,</i> by the poet
Yamanoue-something-or-other...

00:06:11.333 --> 00:06:14.708
There, there.
Don't cry, Hisui.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.917
No crying, Hisui!

00:06:16.917 --> 00:06:18.458
Sorry about that, Hisui.

00:06:18.917 --> 00:06:22.833
I know I've said this before,
but Kin'u, Gyokuto, and Hisui...

00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:23.333
FOUR-EYED OWL DEMON - YOTSUME

00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:25.458
They all have very unique names.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.417
It was Miroku's choice.

00:06:28.583 --> 00:06:30.958
Miroku sure is very knowledgeable.

00:06:34.375 --> 00:06:38.375
Speaking of which,
Inuyasha and Miroku are not back yet?

00:06:38.417 --> 00:06:43.000
From what I hear, the demon
they're dealing with is a bit of trouble.

00:06:43.417 --> 00:06:44.625
I see.

00:06:44.917 --> 00:06:47.125
A landslide collapsed a nearby tomb,

00:06:47.167 --> 00:06:50.875
and the demon that was sealed there
ended up getting out...

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:54.833
Is this it?

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:56.750
It's just bones.

00:06:57.125 --> 00:07:00.667
So many have been attacked
since the tomb collapsed.

00:07:00.708 --> 00:07:02.083
And it's only their heads
that have been taken.

00:07:02.083 --> 00:07:04.208
HALF-HUMAN, HALF-DEMON - INUYASHA

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.167
DELINQUENT
MONK -
MIROKU

00:07:06.167 --> 00:07:07.792
– Miroku!
– Yes.

00:07:08.333 --> 00:07:10.167
It's targeting us from close-by.

00:07:13.667 --> 00:07:16.167
A DEMON SEALED BY KIKYO - ROOT HEAD

00:07:18.417 --> 00:07:20.667
– Th-Their heads!
– It can't be...

00:07:21.583 --> 00:07:23.083
Tessaiga!

00:07:26.667 --> 00:07:27.917
He did it!

00:07:30.917 --> 00:07:32.208
Serves you right.

00:07:33.917 --> 00:07:36.542
Thank you very much, good monk.

00:07:36.833 --> 00:07:39.542
Hey! I'm the one who destroyed it!

00:07:40.667 --> 00:07:43.042
Though it seems to have
run away for now...

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:46.417
Inuyasha,
we aren't quite done yet.

00:07:46.875 --> 00:07:47.708
Huh?

00:07:48.208 --> 00:07:51.292
Could you lead us
to the collapsed tomb?

00:07:53.375 --> 00:07:54.792
Here it is.

00:07:55.417 --> 00:07:56.917
This is quite bad.

00:08:02.542 --> 00:08:03.667
This is...

00:08:05.042 --> 00:08:07.000
Kikyo's arrow?

00:08:07.917 --> 00:08:10.917
Inuyasha, would you know
anything about this?

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:12.917
Dunno.

00:08:13.417 --> 00:08:18.458
Is that so. We should head back
and ask Lady Kaede, then.

00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:24.917
That was a lousy village.

00:08:24.917 --> 00:08:27.458
Boss, all the villages are, lately.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.333
CAT DEMON - KIRARA

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:47.625
SANGO'S YOUNGER BROTHER - KOHAKU

00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:48.375
Kirara!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:54.375
This is...

00:08:55.083 --> 00:08:56.708
What happened here?

00:08:56.708 --> 00:08:58.375
Root Head...

00:08:59.458 --> 00:09:00.750
Lord Sesshomaru.

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:02.375
I see.

00:09:02.542 --> 00:09:02.792
SESSHOMARU'S VASSAL - JAKEN

00:09:02.792 --> 00:09:05.750
So that demon energy came
from Root Head?

00:09:06.208 --> 00:09:07.542
Master Jaken.

00:09:07.833 --> 00:09:09.208
Please tell me.

00:09:09.208 --> 00:09:11.125
What is this Root Head?

00:09:11.708 --> 00:09:14.958
INUYASHA'S
OLDER HALF-BROTHER -
SESSHOMARU

00:09:16.083 --> 00:09:17.125
Except?

00:09:17.333 --> 00:09:18.500
Except it's...

00:09:18.542 --> 00:09:20.583
– ...annoying.
– Huh?

00:09:20.625 --> 00:09:22.208
Who, me?

00:09:26.167 --> 00:09:27.750
There's no doubt.

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:31.417
VILLAGE ELDER PRIESTESS - KAEDE

00:09:31.833 --> 00:09:33.792
Kikyo's Arrow of Sealing?

00:09:35.833 --> 00:09:44.667
Root Head is a demon my sister sealed
shortly before meeting you, Inuyasha.

00:09:45.125 --> 00:09:50.167
Why didn't Lady Kikyo purge
the demon with the Sacred Arrow instead?

00:09:50.625 --> 00:09:52.583
Who knows?

00:09:52.833 --> 00:09:56.500
At the time, she'd been dealing
with demons of all sorts,

00:09:56.583 --> 00:10:00.917
but I think she was growing tired
of having to kill them.

00:10:02.208 --> 00:10:06.042
That was also around the time
when she helped the bandit Onigumo,

00:10:06.083 --> 00:10:07.875
who eventually became Naraku.

00:10:09.542 --> 00:10:11.208
Root Head...

00:10:12.125 --> 00:10:19.292
was after my sister's Shikon Jewel,
much like how you were.

00:10:20.792 --> 00:10:23.208
Who cares about me?

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.458
YOUNG FOX DEMON -
SHIPPO

00:10:29.333 --> 00:10:30.917
Hey, Kin-Gyo, stop it!

00:10:30.917 --> 00:10:32.458
I wonder what they're talking about.

00:10:32.917 --> 00:10:35.708
As soon as they came back,
they went straight to Lady Kaede.

00:10:37.708 --> 00:10:41.833
They're obviously discussing things
they don't want overheard!

00:10:42.375 --> 00:10:45.500
GIRL WHO ADORES SESSHOMARU - RIN

00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:47.542
You too, Rin?

00:10:49.458 --> 00:10:50.708
Maybe that's them?

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.750
– No! Stay back!
– Kagome.

00:10:57.333 --> 00:11:00.250
Kikyo! Shikon Jewel!

00:11:01.625 --> 00:11:03.292
Give it to me!

00:11:04.042 --> 00:11:05.250
Oh, no!

00:11:05.625 --> 00:11:07.750
What is that thing? Kagome!

00:11:07.875 --> 00:11:10.500
Give me the Shikon Jewel!

00:11:11.583 --> 00:11:12.667
Kagome!

00:11:13.208 --> 00:11:14.250
Hiraikotsu!

00:11:18.417 --> 00:11:20.708
Shippo. Take care of
Kin-Gyo and Hisui.

00:11:20.708 --> 00:11:22.000
S-Sure.

00:11:23.875 --> 00:11:25.083
Sango!

00:11:25.417 --> 00:11:27.000
Kagome!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.417
You won't get away this time!

00:11:32.708 --> 00:11:33.833
Damn it!

00:11:34.208 --> 00:11:35.917
So it's made it this far, huh?

00:11:36.333 --> 00:11:37.458
Yes.

00:11:37.458 --> 00:11:39.042
Kagome, are you okay?

00:11:39.042 --> 00:11:39.917
Y-Yes.

00:11:40.792 --> 00:11:44.292
That demon called me Kikyo.

00:11:44.667 --> 00:11:45.708
Wha...

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:48.542
Inuyasha!
What are you hiding from me?!

00:11:48.875 --> 00:11:51.667
I-I wasn't trying to...

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:56.042
Shippo, you bastard!

00:11:57.125 --> 00:12:00.250
Inuyasha, Lady Kagome is being targeted.

00:12:00.292 --> 00:12:02.208
I think we'd best tell her.

00:12:02.667 --> 00:12:03.625
Tell me what?

00:12:03.667 --> 00:12:07.042
It told us to hand over
the Shikon Jewel.

00:12:07.083 --> 00:12:09.292
Even though it's already
been destroyed!

00:12:10.125 --> 00:12:13.542
Since it had been sealed away
by Lady Kikyo's arrow,

00:12:13.583 --> 00:12:16.292
it didn't know about
the Shikon Jewel's demise.

00:12:17.708 --> 00:12:19.583
That demon is called Root Head.

00:12:19.625 --> 00:12:23.458
Its roots burrow underground
and absorb nutrients from humans.

00:12:23.917 --> 00:12:28.083
So it's not just me?
Aren't the local villagers in danger?

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:30.208
That's correct.

00:12:30.375 --> 00:12:34.333
We must eradicate it from
all six villages surrounding the Sacred Tree.

00:12:35.167 --> 00:12:36.625
Let's go, Inuyasha.

00:12:36.667 --> 00:12:38.083
Y-Yeah.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.833
She's not mad at me?

00:12:43.417 --> 00:12:45.292
He didn't need to hide it.

00:12:49.583 --> 00:12:51.792
So there you are!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.042
So there you are!

00:12:57.083 --> 00:12:58.583
It's pretty big, Kagome.

00:12:58.917 --> 00:13:00.833
I know. Leave it to me.

00:13:04.292 --> 00:13:05.875
Wind Scar!

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:26.583
Brother!

00:13:27.333 --> 00:13:28.417
Kohaku!

00:13:28.833 --> 00:13:30.083
Where's Sister?

00:13:30.125 --> 00:13:31.417
She's with the children.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.167
At Sister's house?

00:13:33.583 --> 00:13:36.167
Yes. I wish I could be there, but...

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:37.667
Understood.

00:13:37.708 --> 00:13:41.292
Brother, you take care of
getting the remaining villagers to safety!

00:13:41.333 --> 00:13:42.333
All right.

00:13:43.708 --> 00:13:45.250
It's times like these...

00:13:45.625 --> 00:13:49.292
I realize just how powerless I am
without the Wind Tunnel.

00:13:55.083 --> 00:13:56.583
Sister, are you okay?

00:13:56.917 --> 00:13:58.250
- Kohaku!
- Kohaku!

00:13:58.417 --> 00:13:59.333
Thank goodness...

00:13:59.917 --> 00:14:02.583
Yes, I don't know why,
but we're fine here...

00:14:03.958 --> 00:14:06.042
Umm...

00:14:06.458 --> 00:14:08.417
What, Shippo?

00:14:08.458 --> 00:14:12.167
If you're just gonna stand there,
why don't you help us?

00:14:12.208 --> 00:14:13.083
You buffoon!

00:14:13.417 --> 00:14:17.583
Lord Sesshomaru wouldn't care
what happens to a human village!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.333
Lord Sesshomaru!

00:14:20.667 --> 00:14:23.458
Sesshomaru!
He's why we've been safe...

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:27.125
Kohaku, watch over Hisui for me.

00:14:27.542 --> 00:14:29.125
What? Sister?

00:14:31.417 --> 00:14:33.083
Let's go, Kirara!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:40.375
Oh, no.

00:14:41.292 --> 00:14:42.458
Hiraikotsu!

00:14:44.708 --> 00:14:45.292
Sango!

00:14:46.458 --> 00:14:49.000
It looks like you're having trouble.

00:14:50.333 --> 00:14:51.208
Yeah.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.500
He's multiplying underground.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.375
Damn it, there's no end to this.

00:15:04.375 --> 00:15:05.292
Hey, Inuyasha.

00:15:05.875 --> 00:15:08.000
Has there been a battle here before?

00:15:08.042 --> 00:15:11.708
Yeah. Neighboring provinces
had a skirmish here.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:14.542
So this thing has plenty of food.

00:15:15.375 --> 00:15:19.500
The roots burrow underground.
But where are they coming from?

00:15:20.458 --> 00:15:21.792
Let's go, Kagome.

00:15:24.625 --> 00:15:26.292
– Put me down, Inuyasha!
– What?!

00:15:26.625 --> 00:15:29.292
Don't be ridiculous.
You're the target here!

00:15:29.708 --> 00:15:31.000
That's exactly why!

00:15:31.042 --> 00:15:34.542
All these roots here must lead to
Root Head's main body!

00:15:34.833 --> 00:15:36.542
I'll become a decoy and—

00:15:37.417 --> 00:15:40.542
Like I'd let you throw yourself
into danger like that!

00:15:41.417 --> 00:15:45.208
I bet you'd say "yes," if this were Kikyo.

00:15:46.167 --> 00:15:47.375
See, I knew it.

00:15:49.708 --> 00:15:50.500
What?!

00:15:50.542 --> 00:15:51.333
No way...

00:15:51.792 --> 00:15:52.833
Is that...

00:15:53.333 --> 00:15:54.417
Kikyo's arrow...?

00:15:58.792 --> 00:16:01.500
Wait, Granny Kaede shot it?

00:16:02.167 --> 00:16:08.208
I just shot the very same arrow
Sister had used to seal Root Head.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.750
That should draw it out.

00:16:14.208 --> 00:16:17.333
Root Head will definitely respond to it.

00:16:18.792 --> 00:16:19.833
Inuyasha!

00:16:19.875 --> 00:16:20.500
Yeah!

00:16:22.708 --> 00:16:23.708
It's getting away!

00:16:24.958 --> 00:16:26.083
Kagome!

00:16:26.375 --> 00:16:27.708
I won't let you escape!

00:16:37.917 --> 00:16:39.042
Kagome!

00:16:40.792 --> 00:16:43.042
– Are you okay, Kagome?
– Yes.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:44.750
What's that?

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:47.417
It must be
Root Head's main body!

00:16:48.042 --> 00:16:50.042
So it's shown itself.

00:16:54.667 --> 00:16:57.250
Kikyo!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:02.292
I'll eat you whole,
Shikon Jewel and all!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:06.250
For the record,
my name is Kagome!

00:17:06.333 --> 00:17:12.917
And one other thing. The Shikon Jewel
no longer exists in this world, idiot!

00:17:29.167 --> 00:17:31.292
I'll finish you off. Take this!

00:17:32.333 --> 00:17:34.333
Meido Zangetsuha!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.167
Kagome!

00:17:47.583 --> 00:17:48.583
I got it!

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:56.833
They did it!

00:17:56.875 --> 00:17:58.500
The land is being purified!

00:17:58.542 --> 00:17:59.375
Yes.

00:18:00.125 --> 00:18:06.875
Kagome will be fine even without
borrowing my sister's powers.

00:18:16.292 --> 00:18:17.833
Hey, Kagome!

00:18:17.875 --> 00:18:19.500
What is it?

00:18:19.542 --> 00:18:21.750
You almost got eaten back there, dammit!

00:18:22.583 --> 00:18:26.750
Yeah, but I also knew you'd save me.

00:18:27.417 --> 00:18:30.250
Of course I'd save you, you idiot.

00:18:30.958 --> 00:18:33.000
Yep. I trust you.

00:18:33.458 --> 00:18:37.458
So you didn't have to hide the
whole Kikyo thing from me, either.

00:18:39.375 --> 00:18:40.500
Inuyasha?

00:18:43.125 --> 00:18:46.292
Are you upset after all?

00:18:47.125 --> 00:18:50.667
I'm not upset. It's just...

00:18:51.125 --> 00:18:52.208
Sit, boy.

00:18:54.125 --> 00:18:56.542
Have a bit more faith in me, will you?

00:18:59.833 --> 00:19:02.333
This is somewhat nostalgic.

00:19:02.375 --> 00:19:05.250
Let's go home.
The kids are waiting.

00:19:10.167 --> 00:19:16.083
Fate brought us together to
trust and care for each other,

00:19:16.125 --> 00:19:18.833
allowing us to overcome our own destiny.

00:19:20.792 --> 00:19:26.708
All I have left to do is to spend
these days with Inuyasha by my side.

00:19:44.625 --> 00:19:48.750
The Bone Eater's Well
was in the Forest of the Tree of Ages.

00:19:48.792 --> 00:19:53.125
It used to be a dumping ground
for demons that were slain.

00:19:53.458 --> 00:19:57.750
Any bones thrown down the well
would disappear after some time.

00:19:57.792 --> 00:20:01.042
That is how it came to be known
as the Bone Eater's Well.

00:20:01.625 --> 00:20:04.792
However, it seems like
that well has been sealed,

00:20:04.792 --> 00:20:08.375
so it eats no more bones,
and no one can pass through it.

00:20:08.833 --> 00:20:10.125
And yet...

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:13.333
You hail from Reiwa Village.

00:20:13.792 --> 00:20:16.875
How ever were you able to
arrive in these lands?

00:20:17.125 --> 00:20:21.875
Now, Princess Half-Demon,
if you would regale us with your tale...

00:20:22.333 --> 00:20:26.333
You know, don't you?
What will happen to the Shogunate?

00:20:26.708 --> 00:20:28.375
The fate of our clan?

00:20:28.917 --> 00:20:29.875
Your Excellency...

00:20:31.083 --> 00:20:31.875
What is it?

00:20:32.583 --> 00:20:33.375
Run.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:34.792
What?

00:20:34.917 --> 00:20:36.875
– Hey!
– Intruder!

00:20:37.333 --> 00:20:40.417
– You'll get hurt if you stay here.
– Who are you?!

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.125
What is happening?

00:20:43.167 --> 00:20:43.833
Intruder!

00:20:43.875 --> 00:20:45.750
Shut up!

00:20:46.625 --> 00:20:48.583
They're so weak.

00:20:49.375 --> 00:20:52.250
BOUNTY HUNTER - MOROHA

00:20:54.333 --> 00:20:55.250
DEMON SLAYER - SETSUNA

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.208
You are such a handful...

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:02.417
Thank you, Setsuna and Moroha.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.667
Who are you?!

00:21:04.917 --> 00:21:07.417
Who are we? Well...

00:21:09.417 --> 00:21:10.708
Oh?

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:13.375
I knew I smelled something
strange in the air.

00:21:13.417 --> 00:21:15.208
So it was you, Yotsume!

00:21:16.333 --> 00:21:19.917
Since you're here, I might as
well take you out, too!

00:21:21.292 --> 00:21:22.375
Your attacking too soon!

00:21:25.292 --> 00:21:26.625
An apparition?!

00:21:27.208 --> 00:21:28.000
Oh, shoot!

00:21:28.292 --> 00:21:29.167
You're open!

00:21:40.583 --> 00:21:42.875
What a sore loser..

00:21:43.083 --> 00:21:44.292
Wait, Moroha.

00:21:44.792 --> 00:21:48.792
He seems to know things.
We should nab him and make him talk.

00:21:48.833 --> 00:21:51.292
Then we <i>do</i> have to chase after him!

00:21:55.167 --> 00:21:56.042
Your Excellency.

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.042
I'll be taking this.

00:22:01.583 --> 00:22:02.875
Who were they?

00:22:02.917 --> 00:22:04.083
Oh, that's right.

00:22:06.083 --> 00:22:08.583
And I'll be taking this, too.

00:22:09.667 --> 00:22:12.333
Well, see you around!

00:23:44.042 --> 00:23:46.167
Setsuna is my younger twin sister.

00:23:46.542 --> 00:23:50.958
We were separated ten years ago,
but we finally meet again!

00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:53.583
But why is she attacking me?!

00:23:53.625 --> 00:23:55.625
Those are my only words for you.

00:23:55.667 --> 00:23:57.542
That is why you will die tonight.

00:23:57.583 --> 00:24:01.625
Moroha also appeared through
the Sacred Tree at the shrine.

00:24:01.667 --> 00:24:04.917
What? They brought
some weird demon along, too?!

00:24:05.375 --> 00:24:08.542
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon:</i>
"The Three Princesses"

00:24:08.583 --> 00:24:24.064
You also have a Rainbow Pearl?
